# Generated hook wiring. Never tracked: it carries this machine's absolute
# binary path, and the Antigravity desktop app executes a workspace's
# .agents/hooks.json on open, with no trust prompt and before any user input
# (measured 2026-08-22, docs/qna/what-does-opening-a-repo-in-antigravity-run.md).
# This repository is public, so a tracked one would be an armed trap for anyone
# who clones and opens it. .claude/ and .codex/ are ignored for the first reason
# alone; this one has both.
.agents/hooks.json
.codex/

# Python bytecode (e.g. from skill helper scripts)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

